                            "playtime_at_review": 1984,
                            "last_played": 1790736977
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So, I played through this game about 9 years ago, and although I didn't write a review at the time, I remember thoroughly loving it.  The humour, the charm, all great.\r\n\r\nNow, I'm not sure if it's just modern standards or lower attention spans, but playing through it now is still fun, but the adventuring part now feels a lot more repetitive and boring than I recall it being in the past, and comprises a lot of what you spend your playtime doing, so caveat emptor in that regard.\r\n\r\nStill, it's hard not to recommend.  The writing is great, it's pretty cozy, and probably still the benchmark for shopkeeping games.",
